{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":502259,"name":"Ted Glenwright","username":"Ted_Glenwright","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/t/b4bc9f/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-27T20:58:23.942Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-502259-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-502259-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCloud Agent (GitHub, Slack, Web, Linear)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-502259-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-502259-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSubject: Grok Bot Finance: can’t link a second institution (Schwab) after the first Plaid link\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHi,\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI installed the new Finance plugin in Grok Bot today (Sep 27). I linked Chase through Plaid, and it’s active and working. Now I want to add Charles Schwab, but I can’t find a way to open Plaid again for a second institution.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHere’s what I tried:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eI looked on the Finance plugin page and under Settings, then Plugins, for an add-account or manage-accounts option. I didn’t find one.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eI uninstalled and reinstalled the Finance plugin. It reconnected automatically with Chase already linked, and it never showed the Plaid window again.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHow do I link more institutions (Schwab, and later E*TRADE) to the Finance connector? If that isn’t possible yet, is it planned, and is there a way to reset the connection so I can pick several institutions in one Plaid session?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThanks,\u003cbr\u003e\nTed Glenwright\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-502259-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-502259-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTry to add a second institution\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-502259-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-502259-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAllow me to chose additional banks\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-502259-operating-system-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-502259-operating-system-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eiOS\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-502259-version-information-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-502259-version-information-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eiOS is where I was trying it\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-502259-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-502259-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo - Cursor works, but with this issue\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":5,"updated_at":"2026-10-01T03:37:47.251Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":2,"reads":9,"readers_count":8,"score":11.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":173151,"topic_slug":"plaid-multiple-banks","display_username":"Ted Glenwright","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":3,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":134511,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"use